WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:17.248
At recess that day, I sat on a wall by myself.

2
00:00:17.249 --> 00:00:22.484
Mr. Dalmati marched over to the bumpy slide and blew his whistle.

3
00:00:22.485 --> 00:00:27.794
Kids were pushing each other and arguing about who was first in line.

4
00:00:27.795 --> 00:00:31.152
Molly and Jenny came over to me.

5
00:00:31.153 --> 00:00:35.333
"You're so quiet today, Iggy," said Molly.

6
00:00:35.334 --> 00:00:39.479
"Are you thinking of a new invention?" asked Jenny.

7
00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:44.955
"No," I said. "I already thought of one—a Fabulous Glasses-Finder.

8
00:00:44.956 --> 00:00:47.051
But no one wanted to use it.

9
00:00:47.052 --> 00:00:50.515
Now I'm out of ideas."

10
00:00:50.516 --> 00:00:54.490
"Just look around," said Molly, waving her hand.

11
00:00:54.491 --> 00:01:00.263
"Mrs. Romano said you should search for problems right under your nose."

12
00:01:00.264 --> 00:01:03.555
Mr. Dalmati blew his whistle.

13
00:01:03.556 --> 00:01:06.931
"No pushing and shoving!" he said.

14
00:01:06.932 --> 00:01:11.801
The kids waiting to go on the slide were acting wilder than ever.

15
00:01:11.802 --> 00:01:16.931
"I've got a problem," said Jenny. "A big problem."

16
00:01:16.932 --> 00:01:19.831
"What's wrong?" asked Molly.

17
00:01:19.832 --> 00:01:25.316
"I flunked my spelling test today," said Jenny.

18
00:01:25.317 --> 00:01:29.721
"I always get one hundred on my spelling tests."

19
00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:32.758
"Did you study?" I asked.

20
00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:35.891
"I tried to study," said Jenny.

21
00:01:35.892 --> 00:01:38.082
"But I was pretty busy last night.

22
00:01:38.083 --> 00:01:41.946
I have a math test tomorrow, and I was studying for that too.

23
00:01:41.947 --> 00:01:47.640
All those numbers gave me a headache!"

24
00:01:47.641 --> 00:01:51.418
"That is a problem," said Molly.

25
00:01:51.419 --> 00:01:56.741
"I wish you could invent something to help me, Iggy," said Jenny.

26
00:01:56.742 --> 00:02:01.250
"I'm having a lot of trouble at school lately."

27
00:02:01.251 --> 00:02:04.720
"I'm sure I can think of something," I said.

28
00:02:04.721 --> 00:02:07.645
I couldn't believe I said that!

29
00:02:07.646 --> 00:02:11.206
I had no idea how to fix Jenny's problem.

30
00:02:11.207 --> 00:02:15.498
"Oh, Iggy, that would be great!" said Jenny.

31
00:02:15.499 --> 00:02:18.141
Jenny looked so hopeful.

32
00:02:18.142 --> 00:02:21.738
Now I had to find a way to help her.

33
00:02:21.739 --> 00:02:29.104
After school Molly and I stopped at Josh and Jenny's apartment.

34
00:02:29.105 --> 00:02:32.567
Jenny showed her dad her spelling test.

35
00:02:32.568 --> 00:02:35.206
Mr. Chen looked upset.

36
00:02:35.207 --> 00:02:38.959
"Jenny, what happened?" he asked.

37
00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:43.282
"You usually get all the words right on your spelling tests!"

38
00:02:43.283 --> 00:02:46.533
"I know," said Jenny.

39
00:02:46.534 --> 00:02:49.318
"I just can't seem to pay attention lately.

40
00:02:49.319 --> 00:02:52.328
And I have a math test tomorrow."

41
00:02:52.329 --> 00:02:56.116
"Try to study hard tonight," Mr. Chen said.

42
00:02:56.117 --> 00:02:57.234
"I can help you.

43
00:02:57.235 --> 00:03:01.661
And if you're still having problems, I'll speak to your teacher."

44
00:03:01.662 --> 00:03:06.757
We sat down at Josh and Jenny's kitchen table to have a snack.

45
00:03:06.758 --> 00:03:11.425
Mr. Chen went into his magic room to practice his tricks.

46
00:03:11.426 --> 00:03:14.622
He was planning a new magic show.

47
00:03:14.623 --> 00:03:21.171
"Too bad your dad doesn't have a magic trick to fix your problem," Molly said to Jenny.

48
00:03:21.172 --> 00:03:26.996
Josh laughed. "Right now Dad is practicing cutting people in half!"

49
00:03:26.997 --> 00:03:31.915
"Hey, isn't that division?" joked Molly.

50
00:03:31.916 --> 00:03:37.806
"I've already told Dad that I don't want to be cut in half," said Jenny.

51
00:03:37.807 --> 00:03:41.710
"It's just a trick, Jenny," said Josh.

52
00:03:41.711 --> 00:03:44.848
"Dad doesn't really cut people in half.

53
00:03:44.849 --> 00:03:49.014
But he could turn you into a rabbit," he teased her.

54
00:03:49.015 --> 00:03:53.931
"I don't think a rabbit would get good grades on spelling," I pointed out.

55
00:03:53.932 --> 00:03:59.264
That made everyone laugh, even Jenny.

56
00:03:59.265 --> 00:04:00.413
"Wait a minute.

57
00:04:00.414 --> 00:04:03.101
Look at this!" said Molly.

58
00:04:03.102 --> 00:04:05.789
She picked up a book from the table.

59
00:04:05.790 --> 00:04:10.465
The title was Hypnosis Made Easy.

60
00:04:10.466 --> 00:04:14.266
"We could hypnotize you, Jenny!" said Molly.

61
00:04:14.267 --> 00:04:18.971
"Then you might be able to tell us why you're having trouble in school."

62
00:04:18.972 --> 00:04:21.530
"Yeah!" I chimed in.

63
00:04:21.531 --> 00:04:25.456
"I saw a lady hypnotize someone on TV once.

64
00:04:25.457 --> 00:04:29.124
It's simple. First the hypnotist put a man in a trance.

65
00:04:29.125 --> 00:04:33.216
She made him act like a chicken and asked him a bunch of questions.

66
00:04:33.217 --> 00:04:37.389
Then later she woke him up."

67
00:04:37.390 --> 00:04:41.311
But Jenny looked worried by our idea.

68
00:04:41.312 --> 00:04:45.317
"What if you can't wake me up again?" she said.

69
00:04:45.318 --> 00:04:48.166
"I'd be hypnotized forever."

70
00:04:48.167 --> 00:04:50.312
She shook her head.

71
00:04:50.313 --> 00:04:58.113
"Maybe you should cut me in half instead!"
